              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 14.27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Byuka wa nkota we, urwane n'umushumba wanjye, urwane n'umuntu mugenzi wanjye, ni ko Uwiteka Nyiringabo avuga, kubita umwungeri intama zisandare, kandi n'abato nzabashyiraho ukuboko kwanjye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwiteka aravuga ati “Muri icyo gihugu cyose, ibice bibiri byacyo bizarimbuka bipfe, ariko icya gatatu kizasigara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi icyo gice cya gatatu nzakinyuza mu muriro, mbatunganye nk'uko batunganya ifeza. Nzabagerageza nk'uko bagerageza izahabu, bazambaza izina ryanjye, nanjye nzabumvira. Nzabita abantu banjye, na bo bazavuga bati ‘Uwiteka ni we Mana yanjye.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.13.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
